      "notes": "UC Santa Cruz Library's Omeka archive of posters, tickets, photographs, fan art and first-person recollections, queried through its public /api/items endpoint by date; scripts/collect/collect_gdao_show_items.py indexes item metadata only: item id, title, item type, item sets, date and coverage fields, creator, item page URL and at most 200 characters of the item description, never files, media or thumbnails. Contributed recollections are subjective testimony: cite the archive and the contributor and do not treat an item as a canonical show fact. Entry restored by the Task A agent after a file revert dropped it; Task B owns its content and should review the paths and notes."
